    "narrative": "The Austin Waves enter today\u2019s slate with a high-ceiling lineup anchored by **Kyle Tucker** (78.10) and **Andy Pages** (70.62), both of whom capitalize on a prime matchup against Randy V\u00e1squez. **Kyle Tucker** remains the clear priority start, leveraging a strong base projection further bolstered by the favorable pitching profile of his opponent. Similarly, **Jackson Merrill** (68.44) and **Cole Carrigg** (67.90) are positioned for significant production; **Jackson Merrill** specifically benefits from the slow delivery of Roki Sasaki, which aids our organizational imperative to hunt stolen bases, while **Cole Carrigg** utilizes a +14% park factor boost to vault into the upper echelon of our daily scoring.\n\nIn the infield, **Sam Antonacci** (60.82) earns the start over internal alternatives due to a favorable combination of leadoff positioning and a high xwOBA against Slade Cecconi. **Liam Hicks** (59.93) and **Josh Jung** (59.47) provide high-floor stability, with **Liam Hicks** benefiting from a dynamic platoon advantage that makes him a more attractive play than **Drake Baldwin** (57.02) today. The most difficult bench decision involved **Nolan Schanuel** (42.11); while he remained within striking distance of the starting rotation, his matchup against the elite arm of Bryce Miller (2.42 xERA) penalized his overall projection too heavily to justify a start over the higher-scoring options like **Dominic Smith** (47.85) or **Brayan Rocchio** (44.07).\n\nWe remain on high alert regarding the \"Lineup Pending\" status for several key players, including **Miguel Vargas** and **Drake Baldwin**. Managers should monitor final confirmation closely, as any unexpected shift in the batting order could necessitate a quick pivot for the **Austin Waves**. While **Josh Lowe** (45.34) faces a tough assignment against Bryce Miller, his inclusion is secured by our aggressive strategy to capture stolen base opportunities. Conversely, we continue to manage the absence of **Luis Robert Jr.** on the IL, trusting the depth of our bench to mitigate his void until his return.",
